OL,3,GNEWSAUB40 star defends Rooney over I'm 
OL,4,Aa Celeb singing                        
OL,6,F"How is it cultural misappropriation?  
OL,7,FAstro was a Jamaican Rasta. So there's 
OL,8,Fpeople going 'why is he singing in a   
OL,9,FJamaican accent?' He was Jamaican, you 
OL,10,Fknow."                                 
